      "headline": "Group Chief Product and Technology Officer",
      "about": "James Brett is an Author, CTO, and digital leader who is passionate about developing people and organisations to create a positive future for humanity.\n\nJames has worked in tech for 20 years, initially as a highly technical developer and more recently performing various roles as a CTO, Digital Strategist, and Leadership Coach for executive teams.\n\nJames led the ThoughtWorks Digital Transformation Practice where he partnered with Jim Highsmith (a founding signatory of the Agile Manifesto) to bring Digital ways of working to ThoughtWorks’ top clients globally.\n\nJames has worked with a variety of scale-ups and large corporates and was responsible for the digital transformation strategy for Woolworths where he created the WooliesX concept and strategy.\n\nHe holds a global perspective on digital, having lived in the USA, UK, China, and Australia, allowing him to understand the complex cultural and market dynamics that impact technology and product delivery across continents.\n\nJames' latest book, Evolving Digital Leadership (published July 2018) and has been extremely well received by digital leaders across the globe.\n\nJames is also a certified Leadership Agility Coach, Integrative Enneagram Coach, Neuro-semantics NLP Master Practitioner, and Holacracy Practitioner. He leverages this unique combination of psychology and digital skills to grow high-performance teams, leaders and organisations.",
